  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi></math>&nbsp;be a real number. Consider the matrix <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></math> is a singular matrix, then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn><mi>&#946;</mi></math> is _____ ."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>det</mo><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Now for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;to be singular</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></mfenced><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></mfenced><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></mfenced><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>As <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>here&#160;</mtext><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now solving&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
